BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20240722T130000Z
DTEND:20240802T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260722T093117Z
UID:2nnve0neqbemgcbou9ml0f70f3@google.com
CREATED:20240319T170953Z
DESCRIPTION:Session 1: Monday July  22 – Friday July 26\nSession 2: Monday 
 July 29– Friday August 2\n(You can sign up for either session or both sessi
 ons - if a preferred session indicates it is sold out you can add your name
  to a waitlist by clicking here\n\n \n\nTimes: 9AM – 3PM each day (drop-off
  time from 8:30AM-9:00AM)\n \n\nLocation: Center Street Gym\, 203 E Center 
 St\, Moab\, Utah  84532\n \n\nWho can sign up?: kids ages 7 – 15\n\nWhat wi
 ll the kids do?: Campers will learn all the circus basics – juggling of dif
 ferent forms (flower sticks\, balls\, clubs\, poi\, diabolos\, plate spinni
 ng)\, acrobatics (tumbling\, mini-trampoline\, partner acrobatics\, human p
 yramids)\, and balancing (tight wire\, rolling globe\, rola bola\, stilts\,
  and unicycles). Aerial skills such as Spanish Web\, trapeze\, and silks wi
 ll also be offered. Each camper gets to try all the different skills\, then
  towards the end of the week\, they choose two to specialize in. The last d
 ay of camp finishes with a show for family and friends!\n\nCost: Circus cam
 p sessions are $225 per week. . Contact Jens (jens@phxyouthcircus.org) for 
 more information on opportunity for parent volunteer credit.\n\nCamp limit:
  Registrations will be limited to 32 campers for each session\n\nCancellati
 on policy –  Full payment is due to register for camp. If you need to cance
 l your registration\, you can receive a full refund if the cancellation is 
 within 6 weeks of the date of purchase and more than four weeks from the st
 art of the camp session you have paid for. Less than four weeks prior to th
 e start of a camp session\, credit will be given for camps in the future an
 d handled on a case-by-case basis.
LAST-MODIFIED:20240319T170953Z
LOCATION:Center Street Gym\, 203 E Center St\, Moab\, Utah  84532
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:2024 Circus Arts Camp in Moab\, Utah
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
